{
  "_note": "Cases 2 and 3 emit the identical FormalParameter JSON and are parsed back differently, because `VREPayload.file_for_input` resolves the defaultValue against the crate's files rather than reading additionalType. A consumer that decides 'is this slot a file?' from the declared type will disagree with this library on case 2.",
